<title>SLOVAKIA: TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD POLAND 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SLOVAKIA LEAD POLAND 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slovakia took a 2-0 lead over</p>
<p>Poland in their Davis Cup Euro/African Zone group two, third</p>
<p>round tie after winning the opening singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Jan Kroslak beat Bartolomiej Dabrowski 7-6 (9-7) 6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Karol Kucera beat Adam Skrzypczak 6-1 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
